---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../../../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../../../data/site';
import { u } from '../../../lib/paths';
---

<Base title="Request a housing repair" description="How to ask Housing and Residential Life to fix something in a University of Mars residence hall.">
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Housing"
    title="Request a housing repair"
    lede="Routine repairs are scheduled on weekdays. Safety issues are handled by phone, at any hour."
    crumbs={[
      { href: '/support/', label: 'Student Support' },
      { href: '/support/articles/housing-repair/', label: 'Housing repair' },
    ]}
  />
  <article class="prose wrap narrow">
    <p>Include the hall, the room number, and a short description of what failed. A photo helps for furniture and leaks that have stopped.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Plumbing, electrical, heat, furniture, and pests go through the Help Center.</li>
      <li>You do not need to be present for a lock shop or a lamp replacement. You do need to be present for a pest treatment.</li>
      <li>If several roommates see the same problem, one request is enough.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Call instead</h2>
    <p>
      Call <a href={site.repairHref}>{site.repairPhone}</a> for an active leak, no heat on an unsafe night, a power loss
      in the whole unit, or a door that will not lock. Those calls are answered overnight.
    </p>
    <p class="page-actions">
      <a class="btn" href={u('/support/?category=housing-repair#request')}>Request a repair</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
